  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\n{他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\nPattern: Xをくすぐる\n\nKANJI:\nRarely written with kanji ({擽|くすぐ}る), usually hiragana.\n\nASPECT (ている):\nくすぐっている - is tickling (action in progress)\n\nFIGURATIVE EXPRESSIONS:\n・{好奇心|こうきしん}をくすぐる - to pique one's curiosity\n・{虚栄心|きょえいしん}をくすぐる - to appeal to one's vanity\n・{冒険心|ぼうけんしん}をくすぐる - to appeal to one's sense of adventure\n\nRELATED:\n・くすぐったい - ticklish; embarrassing\n・こそばゆい - ticklish (regional variant)",
